  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/07/IMG_8514.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Aquest dissabte ha sigut l&#39;ofrena de flors a <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=39117\" target=\"_blank\">Santa Anna, la patrona d&#39;Artesa</a>, pedania d&#39;Onda. Tamb&eacute; ha hagut bous amb vaques de la ramaderia de &#39;La Se&ntilde;ora&#39;, de Vallat, i prova i embolada del bou de la ramaderia MANOLO GONZ&Aacute;LEZ, de nom BUSCALIOS, que li ha donat un esglai al rodador&nbsp;Jes&uacute;s Alcorc&oacute;n.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabteprimerfestesartesa13/img_8394.jpg\" alt=\"img_8394\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabteprimerfestesartesa13/img_8395.jpg\" alt=\"img_8395\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabteprimerfestesartesa13/img_8396.jpg\" alt=\"img_8396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabteprimerfestesartesa13/img_8397.jpg\" alt=\"img_8397\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabteprimerfestesartesa13/img_8398.jpg\" alt=\"img_8398\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabteprimerfestesartesa13/img_8399.jpg\" alt=\"img_8399\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabteprimerfestesartesa13/img_8401.jpg\" alt=\"img_8401\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dissabteprimerfestesartesa13/img_8402.jpg\" alt=\"img_8402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;